  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe’s well-aimed weapon drives into the meat of your palm, causing leaking blood to make your grip unreliably slippery.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> For the rest of the encounter, at the beginning of each of your turns, roll 1d10/2 and subtract one. Then treat the hand as having lost that many fingers (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.SYjWiKDzMS6CtROJ]{Amputated Parts}) during that turn only.</p>"
